{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "57b34253c983d2864c93bd4e19afbf7a060cef86c6957c8a6593908ad82db92f", "ja": "春香さんが演じた役って、たしか……\n騎士と、病弱な女の子……でしたよね……？", "zh": "春香小姐扮演的角色，我记得……\n是骑士，还有体弱多病的女孩……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "f9b14ff6b943f37e2a961837d7fe019851a09fdb90353982985c61c3b9e62083", "ja": "うん、そうだよ！　最初の舞台は、\n騎士を目指している凛々しい女の子で……。", "zh": "嗯，是的！第一部舞台剧里，我演的是一位以骑士为目标的英气少女……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "38e0fa0ce33b3854a0ab9606ba424c750410c84caba23498f370a9e18aabc97d", "ja": "次のお芝居は、病弱な女の子。\nどっちも、違う難しさがあったなぁって。", "zh": "接下来的演出是体弱多病的女孩。\n我觉得这两个角色各自都有不同的难度呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "c29d6b3ea72b0516b74cbe6c9810de66f1821beeaf70cd809092a2d126b4de27", "ja": "聞いていると、せ、正反対の役に思えますね……。\nすごいなぁ……。", "zh": "听起来，似、似乎是完全相反的角色呢……。\n好厉害啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "85065d375a6a3d77b48d63b62c18c7752e8e95c64e854fe88576934810244028", "ja": "私も、以前春香さんとご一緒した際に、\nとても驚いたのを覚えています。", "zh": "我以前和春香小姐一起演出时，也记得自己非常惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "e4e506cb350d4115c88c1300f7c6a532322a6cc91991a65f739831782895a376", "ja": "演じている春香さんは、普段の春香さんとは\nまるで別人のようで……。", "zh": "饰演角色时的春香小姐，和她平时的样子简直判若两人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "98b7f7c22efac20fcd31900e93fd1c1370006cb80190bb4e1bce7252d7693225", "ja": "えへへ、そんなに褒められると照れちゃうな。\nでも、ありがとう！", "zh": "嘿嘿，被夸得这么厉害，我都不好意思了。\n不过，还是谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "88e0fcad1284c195a4bf6b26f8217b11c14a00014da944b6cc18a8a81c8f8abd", "ja": "それで、次は定期公演のセンターを……？", "zh": "那么，接下来是要让我担任定期公演的中心位……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "a615ee28e96fe2baa59aab6f24e210220c7de2a5cfcd94dd3914ce1ee216faa7", "ja": "うん！　今回の舞台を見て、初めて\n私を知ってくれた人が、たくさんいるみたいで。", "zh": "嗯！看了这次的舞台，好像有很多人是第一次认识我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "3d2508b525850d6dd78719d9ea64f2ea4b01b98b09f2b0fc5db0d0e3713ca96c", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、次の公演は\nセンターを任せたい、って言ってくれたんだ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生说，下次演出\n想让我担任C位呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "d631f8fe6e18854f24ce595d00be4b908bd2659a414d484ccb96716569faef96", "ja": "新しいごヒイキ様方に、大和撫子としての\n春香さんを見ていただく機会ということですね。", "zh": "也就是说，这是让新顾主们见识春香小姐\n身为大和抚子一面的大好机会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "3463fec703787be027c76620481f2b31b6d2d88e63a47d555609dc4b15ea7b7b", "ja": "なら、ご一緒する私たちも、がんばらなくては♪", "zh": "那和我们一起参加的大家，也得加油才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "e73104fa8fb2b33fcd56598e3d8e001429b6d0f953b445a270000bac174ec36b", "ja": "そ、そうだね……！\n私も、がんばらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "对、对啊……！\n我也得加油才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "fd7caf8cbd068320263d070e572462e0302a5f9317aee2af3b50863516a65e1d", "ja": "でも私、ちょっと心配なことがあって。\n最近、お芝居のお仕事が忙しかったでしょ？", "zh": "不过，我有件事有点担心。\n最近戏剧的工作很忙，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "d5f6206da83e213d69f2858fa4875a807e9f907dbe31b59dd451d6ee28a808bd", "ja": "あんまり歌えてないから、ヘタになっちゃって\nないかなって。だから、たくさん練習しないと……。", "zh": "没怎么练习唱歌，就担心自己是不是退步了。\n所以，不多加练习可不行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1015_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ebbf454792e0588de71e3592be84c112af795af5cd879c31bdd9e2e38eb8a3a2", "ja": "お疲れさま！\n3人とも、もう揃ってたんだな！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n没想到你们3人已经到齐了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "a5f052d2c12d063c1959d302d41282c77770cb54189b8194b62d469bf3fcabc6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n琴葉ちゃんとやよいも、お疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n琴叶和弥生也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "f6c01190376194be2742206bea22eb3ba76b742a743baa40d1a8e9aa6f2c28eb", "ja": "春香さん、お疲れさまです！\nエミリーちゃん、可憐さんも！", "zh": "春香姐，辛苦了！\n艾米莉，可憐也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "a22c38d48ba463a9cf662e05036a251f25f513190f3fd260e8434df9b683220f", "ja": "これで全員ですか？\n{$P$}。", "zh": "这样就到齐了吗？\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1020_p", "source_sha256": "abdf9e3e4d853cdd319afda903eb61c8278846cfd4d5150c3cba2ea031a32e5f", "ja": "ああ。それじゃ、早速ミーティングを始めよう。\nまず、春香には事前に話した通りだけど……。", "zh": "啊。那么就马上开始会议吧。\n首先，和之前跟春香说过的一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1021_p", "source_sha256": "61d4abd6194744cbe4a0c90034bdb71a95640ae2ee9be92fc27d14a1a6bde21b", "ja": "次の定期公演のセンターは、春香で行こうと思ってる。\nメンバーは、ここにいる5人だ。", "zh": "下一场定期公演的中心位，我想让春香来担任。\n成员就是在场的这5人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "644793ff4480e767190537a2a47ba5ff7b4e3b41692878b8c1973b6f2f026a69", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　みんなも、よろしくね！\nそれで、私のソロ曲なんですけど……。", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！大家也请多多关照！\n另外，关于我的独唱曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1023_p", "source_sha256": "830fd88ea423e58d23db876bcf53eebca3901b0d463b0e29aa0640dd4eb25a44", "ja": "その事なんだけど……前回のセンター公演は、\n春香のミニツアーライブの千秋楽だっただろ？", "zh": "关于那件事……上次的中心公演，是春香迷你巡演的最终场，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1024_p", "source_sha256": "62e61d4a6ea5ce6036f8ce06e2d4176c7d8cd5de9a2fdf5906c731c6518dbd5b", "ja": "つまり、春香のファンの人たち向けだったと思うんだ。\nでも今回は、新しいファンの人たちも大勢いると思う。", "zh": "所以，我想上次应该是面向春香的粉丝们的。\n不过这次，我觉得也会有很多新粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c7e5b415d6e906594e5d1a9e84c29f2e56940a2778b40ca70958f009275f7be2", "ja": "それで、色々悩んだんだけど……\nこの曲はどうかなと思って。", "zh": "所以我苦恼了很多……\n觉得这首歌怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "d078230f06e850c872de6b1310140e56654dd73e559605ced7c565a95f7e5e52", "ja": "えっ！？　こ、これって……『I Want』ですか？\nたしかに、まだ劇場では歌ってない曲ですけど……。", "zh": "诶！？这、这是……《I Want》吗？\n确实是还没在剧场唱过的歌，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4bf00721b993ef794ea5a201e95714473e721fd78130a9efe3f1ab437ef2286", "ja": "春香ちゃんの曲としては、ちょっと意外かも……。\nもちろん、素敵だとは思いますけど。", "zh": "作为春香的歌曲来说，有点出乎意料呢……\n当然，我觉得很棒就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "8e544d85d4a2898c4fb3323f7f6be779f979765bbcb8cda5d5bae4e2b8f39842", "ja": "そ、そうですね……普段の春香さんとは、その……\n雰囲気が、だいぶ違う気がするので……。", "zh": "是、是啊……和往常的春香小姐相比，那个……\n感觉气氛相差得挺多的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "e47ce72e697459e8890b7acb9c6079bb291204b1d981b875acdb48f3b8058233", "ja": "みんな、ビックリするかも……？", "zh": "大家可能会吓一跳……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f619fbe564e9170761c8402dee2b414732bac0d022d3bc60a441615a37987059", "ja": "やっぱり驚くか……。そうだな。\n普段の春香とは、だいぶイメージが違うと思う。", "zh": "果然还是会吓一跳吗……这样啊。\n我觉得这和春香平时的形象，差别还挺大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1032_p", "source_sha256": "20bc07f04fc4f1437f2bafb7f51492a00cb92dce4725be15bf8c8dda035937fe", "ja": "公演までは時間もあるし、変更も可能だけど……\n春香も、よかったら考えてみてくれないか？", "zh": "距离公演还有时间，也可以做调整，不过……\n春香，你愿意的话，要不要也考虑一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1033_p", "source_sha256": "bcfec152df50180c3e7df03de9e7b740be0aff00ceb657e64188fd48e3cc6b4f", "ja": "この曲を歌うなら、どんなアプローチがいいか。\nそれとも、違う曲の方がいいのか……。", "zh": "如果要唱这首歌，采取什么样的方式比较好呢？\n还是说，换一首歌更合适……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_100_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "c41313e91f1a5f630ed2ac966838e0ba68722200e8137e8f5d49cbcd125bcc28", "ja": "わ、わかりました……考えてみます。\n……。", "zh": "我、我知道了……我会想想看的。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
